ty"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 through 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, and so did June to July and August to September. In 2025, August to September came in at 31% of normal and November to December at 52%. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 49% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
